305: **Proven.** If both companion charge/mass ratios equal \(a_w\), define \(\delta U=\sum_jm_j[1/r_{pj}-\langle1/r_{pj}\rangle]\). Then \(\delta\varphi=a_w\delta U\), and the common pulsar-pair response is
