# Draft section: a worked white-dwarf charge — retarded scattering memory and its orbital-timescale collapse

Status (2026-09-27, revised after phases 277–279): draft for insertion after §4.5 of `paper/manuscript.md`. It is not integrated. `main.tex` is generated with Pandoc, and neither Pandoc nor TeX is installed on the current build host. Evidence: `notes/REQUEST244`–`REQUEST280` and the manifests under `outputs/direct-eos-gr33/` bound in `paper/revision-manifest.json`. New bibliography entries needed: `kaplan2014j0337` (Kaplan et al. 2014, arXiv:1402.0407), `ransom2014triple` (Ransom et al. 2014, Nature 505, 520), `bertotti2003cassini` (Bertotti, Iess & Tortora 2003, Nature 425, 374).

